{
  "name": "smithing",
  "normalizations": [
    "At a smithing table: upgrade a worn, enchanted diamond sword with a repair cost to netherite with the upgrade template and an ingot, and offer stone, which no slot takes.",
    "Compare the result offered and the inventory after shift-clicking it out and closing: the netherite sword keeps the diamond sword's damage, enchantments and repair cost, and one template and one ingot are used up.",
    "Use matching flat terrain with natural spawning off."
  ],
  "steps": [
